    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[All forms of stoolball and associated activities are suspended as of 19 March 2020.

Following the Government’s latest advice around social distancing, we would recommend that all forms of stoolball are suspended until further notice. This suspension extends to pre season training, friendlies and any associated Stoolball Activity.]]></Value>
